      "title": "Dividend increased to ₹6.00",
      "body": "Dividend of ₹6.00 is 80% higher than last year. Ex-date: 10th June 2026 Payment date: 23rd July 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.1%, which is about the same as the industry average. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is well covered by both earnings (12% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (24% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 23% per year over the past 10 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 64% over the next 3 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
